meta {
  name: List Branch Lab Test Options
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-lab-tests/options?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~search: Vitamin
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Lightweight `{ id, name, price, sampleName, sampleType, isFasting, …schedule/TAT }`
  options for the Create-Order lab-test picker. Returns the active branch's **active
  default-variant** lab tests only (one orderable row per variant group), so a selected
  id is directly usable as an order item's `branchLabTestId`; `price` is the list price
  (`priceMsrp`, minor units) and `sampleName` (e.g. "Blood (EDTA)"), `sampleType` (e.g.
  "Blood") and `isFasting` (from the first sample in `configSnapshot`) populate the
  Diagnostic Items table. Scoped to the JWT tenant + active branch (no
  `branchId` in the query). `search` matches testName (case-insensitive). Omit
  `page` for the full array; supply `page` for a `{ data, total, page, limit }` envelope.
}
